{
  "_about": "A1 tool selection cases (v8 section 20: >=3 example utterances and >=1 confusion case per tool) for the read tools wired in backend/app/agent/read_agent.py besides B2's two. Same fields as b2_tool_cases.json, plus optional `photo`: true means the request carries a photo, so the test adds the same PHOTO_ATTACHED system message the Agent adds. Optional `shopping_list` (complete_purchase cases): the rows a first `list_shopping` call gets back; the test checks that the model looks up the list first, answers it with these rows, and applies `expect_calls`, `must_not_call` and `args_contain` to the model's next turn. Per v8 the tool owners are B1 (list_inventory), C1 (list_shopping) and A2 (analyze_photo, search_purchase_options); they may edit or add cases. complete_purchase is A1's card tool (v8 flow C), offered when Cosmos is configured; the live test offers it as the Agent does then. C1 owns the Golden Prompts set and may merge these in.",
